# Synapse backend

- Routes under `server/routes/`; register in `server/index.ts`.
- Protected vault routes: `authenticateSession` (`server/middleware/auth.ts`).
- Public wiki: rate-limited, no session; only `AllowPublicPages` vaults.
- Use `ownedVault(vaultId, pmUserId)` before mutating vault/note data.
- After note body/title/path changes: `snapshotRevision` + `rebuildNoteGraph` when appropriate.
- Passive PM status pull: `syncNoteCheckboxesFromPm` — do **not** snapshot revisions for pull-sync (avoids history spam).
- Uploads: `server/services/vaultMedia.ts`; files under `data/uploads/{vaultId}/`.
- Env: `PM_BASE_URL`, `SSO_*`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL`, `JWT_SECRET`, `ENCRYPTION_KEY`, `DB_*`.
